<https://w3id.org/ssbd/core/matter> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/core/matter> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionIRI> <https://w3id.org/ssbd/core/0.0.1/matter> .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/core/matter> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://w3id.org/ssbd/core/0.0.1/reused-terms> .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/core/matter> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/abstract> "\nThis module is a part of the [SSbD Core Ontology](https://w3id.org/ssbd).\nMatter is a physical entity that possess mass and occupies volume.\n\nThis module provides a categorisation of different types of matter entities.\nAt the top it categorise matter into molecular entities (discrete atoms or molecules) and different types of substances (homogeneous properties).\n\nA page illustrating showing how the SSbD Core Ontology categorise models can be found [here](https://ssbd-ontology.github.io/core/docs/matter.html).\n\"\n\n"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/core/matter> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Matter"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/core/matter> <https://w3id.org/widoco/vocab#introduction> "\nThis module is a part of the [SSbD Core Ontology](https://ssbd-ontology.github.io/core/widoco/index-en.html).\nMatter is a physical entity that possess mass and occupies volume.\n\nThis module provides a categorisation of different types of matter entities.\nAt the top it categorise matter into molecular entities (discrete atoms or molecules) and different types of substances (homogeneous properties).\n\nA page illustrating showing how the SSbD Core Ontology categorise models can be found [here](https://ssbd-ontology.github.io/core/docs/matter.html).\n"@en .
