<http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This property is intended to be used with non-literal values. The described resource may be derived from the related resource in whole or in part. Best practice is to identify the related resource by means of a URI or a string conforming to a formal identification system."@en .
