<http://purl.org/dc/terms/accessRights> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "Access Rights may include information regarding access or restrictions based on privacy, security, or other policies. The following preferred Rights Statement individuals are defined: `accr:PUBLIC`, `accr:NON_PUBLIC`, `accr:CONFIDENTIAL`, `accr:RESTRICTED`, `accr:SENSITIVE`"@en .
